        "slc_603ec34d14572ba86a5b26164c15f7cb3f837f4890d06b2b2b630cbc8833b6a6"
      ],
      "text": "Run configs load credentials from a harbor/.env file located relative to the repository root, which must be created before launching a run."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_79f46fb8f916fcbf0fed1fc9d1b87f8f456f71e8fd20e20e28ed0177f71a7c75",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d",
          "git_sha": "cb21379d4d4b396e63606939d48c918103435e49",
          "line_end": 44,
          "line_start": 44,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "scaleapi/swe-interact",
          "url": "https://github.com/scaleapi/SWE-Interact/blob/b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d/README.md#L44-L44"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a27bea6333757b14e2aae1103f3f9988014d7c550a945bcdcac45488815bc818"
      ],
      "text": "The benchmark uses a simulated user (GPT 5.5 high) and rubric grading; the RF task default rubric model is Anthropic Opus 4.5, matching the original SWE Atlas Refactoring task."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_cd5435c7dff41ff183a8e3789f41666f895d9d386fbb3e2e139e8f2686a44acf",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d",
          "git_sha": "cb21379d4d4b396e63606939d48c918103435e49",
          "line_end": 51,
          "line_start": 51,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "scaleapi/swe-interact",
          "url": "https://github.com/scaleapi/SWE-Interact/blob/b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d/README.md#L51-L51"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4cc74f8ed7a85b0b73f3ff3df210af8878699c0546184c2a7150f8a9946e0b43"
      ],
      "text": "The configured API gateway must support both openai/gpt-5.5 and the rubric model anthropic/claude-opus-4-5-20251101; a LiteLLM gateway works, while direct OpenAI endpoints need an EVAL_MODEL override."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_13fcef1ae52698d9948197d72669883f086d8f6ba7fe9b83d1bf8b6b564b0094",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d",
          "git_sha": "cb21379d4d4b396e63606939d48c918103435e49",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 57,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "scaleapi/swe-interact",
          "url": "https://github.com/scaleapi/SWE-Interact/blob/b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d/README.md#L57-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3abe9d2d197c8e39e077be388c6e8d624e7b1cbbe83221d0b0af3acd2f266190"
      ],
      "text": "Per-agent configs require different credentials: Codex configs need only the common block, Claude Code configs need ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, OpenCode needs GEMINI_API_KEY, and kimi-cli needs an OpenAI-compatible endpoint."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3367429383423186304e142183e99eab653d1e43ca258d6590092ce051076d5e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d",
          "git_sha": "cb21379d4d4b396e63606939d48c918103435e49",
          "line_end": 75,
          "line_start": 75,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "scaleapi/swe-interact",
          "url": "https://github.com/scaleapi/SWE-Interact/blob/b32f98c3b8f76ca65e84341d1f30e5af7135f85d/README.md#L75-L75"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_835ab6afe0dcc01ee136042ddc9953d6daa602c51969b33326df32c131872df3"
      ],
      "text": "Multi-turn run configs set the simulated user model to openai/gpt-5.5 through the SIM_USER_MODEL variable."
    },
