      ],
      "text": "Runs are launched from the repository root by executing a run config script, e.g. bash run_configs/multiturn/gpt-5p5-high_codex.sh; a single-turn baseline example is also provided."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3d756c464c48877f6ac4619ca3be8b4701cd7b35802ae6efd521137287be81d7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
